  "display_title": "Belated Regrets",
  "description": "Ji-Won’s track record with men is horrible. It’s so bad that she’s nicknamed “the trash collector” amongst her friends. Unfortunately, the newest addition to the collection is Do-Kyung, her boss. Do-Kyung is rich, handsome, and… incredibly difficult in terms of personality. Ji-Won is very aware that her crush on him will lead to no good, and she’s proven correct after they impulsively spend a heated night together. His selfish and manipulative behavior is a glaring red flag, but she can’t help wanting him. However, even Ji-Won has her limits to how much pain her heart can handle…\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
